WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:35.400
<b>Convenience Store Chio-chan</b>

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.690
<i>It's that day of the month again!</i>

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:39.490
<i>The day my favorite hardcore 
Western game magazine goes on sale!</i>

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.790
<i>Gotta read it at the store before school!</i>

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.790
<b>Soft Serve</b>

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.790
<b>Soft Serve Deluxe</b>

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:46.080
Welcome.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:47.140
Huh?

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:48.660
What?

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:50.710
It's not here!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.010
You can't be serious!

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:57.050
But this is the only local convenience store 
that sells that magazine! It's a godsend!

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:59.860
I can't imagine it sold out 
first thing in the morning.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.810
This wasn't here last month...

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.730
A BL game magazine...

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:11.450
Wait, does this mean they stopped 
getting Western game magazines

00:02:11.450 --> 00:02:13.780
and started getting more BL magazines?

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.150
In a word, they've been exterminated...

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:18.240
<i>It's been exterminated by h**os.</i>

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.250
This isn't good.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.100
<i>What exactly isn't good?</i>

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.670
<i>If we roughly explain the Western 
games that Chio-chan likes so much...</i>

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:28.790
<i>The protagonists are usually old guys,</i>

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:31.400
<i>or guns, and the heroines are gorillas.</i>

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.230
The highlight is when the 
aliens operate on him,

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.570
and they take a buzzsaw to his legs and—

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:37.800
<b>It's pretty violent</b>

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:40.840
<i>They're pretty violent and 
usually don't do well in Japan.</i>

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:46.220
<b>Around the release
time of a new game</b>

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:46.220
Languages             Interface | Full Audio | Subtitles

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:46.220
German
French

00:02:41.110 --> 00:02:44.010
<i>And because of that, the few 
players they have suffer...</i>

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.220
It's a huge title, but there's 
no Japanese version!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:50.190
<b>Official Update</b>

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:50.240
<i>You'll have to pay about 3,000 yen 
more for the Japanese version.</i>

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:52.740
They're taking advantage of us!

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:53.780
I'll still buy it, though...

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.560
<i>This is what happens every time.</i>

00:02:55.560 --> 00:02:58.150
<i>And because of those unfortunate events...</i>

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.570
This game isn't popular in Japan,

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.500
but the series has sold over ten 
million copies around the world!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.830
Doesn't this mean Japanese 
people's tastes are off?

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.300
What the hell is with Japanese RPGs, anyway?!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.700
Everyone's drawn so hot that 
people overseas think they're gay.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.380
How the hell is this kid 
even holding that weapon?!

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.330
Why is this barely-dressed host 
guy even on the battlefield?!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.970
Go back to Shinjuku!

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.260
<i>Is what she ends up saying.</i>

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.050
<i>She's harboring some unjustified resentment.</i>

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:27.110
If only people liked macho guys more...

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.370
Western games would catch on,

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:31.230
and I wouldn't have to pay an extra 
3,000 yen for Japanese language packs...

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.270
All I wish for...

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:38.030
is the prosperity of Japanese games, 
in harmony with the world...

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.820
<b>Kyle</b>

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.820
<b>"I never knew you
could look like that..."</b>

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.040
<b>Aren't you interested
in my thick, full lips?</b>

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.040
Benedito

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.040
<i>Aren't you interested in my thick, full lips?</i>

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:49.860
Oh?

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.510
<i>Well, considering this magazine 
specializes in the subject,</i>

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.780
<i>it's showing a wide range of characters...</i>

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:59.130
<i>I figured all the guys 
would be super scrawny.</i>

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:06.260
<b>Benedito</b>

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:06.260
<b>To think there's a place in this country 
that's even hotter than my home...</b>

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:06.260
<i>To think there's a place in this country 
that's even hotter than my home...</i>

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:15.470
<i>Wait... This is more extreme 
than I thought it'd be,</i>

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:17.190
<i>but in a different way than Western games.</i>

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.230
Are they even allowed to sell 
these at a convenience store?

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:25.860
<b>The cruel yet
mysterious man: Fukayama
"I only know of Hell."</b>

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:23.840
<i>I only know of Hell.</i>

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:27.510
<i>This old guy seems like 
an experienced assassin.</i>

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.210
<i>Someone like him couldn't possibly...</i>

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.200
There's no way this old guy...

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.410
<b>Ba-dump Ba-dump Ba-dump...</b>

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.410
Yeah, there's no way—

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:38.460
<b>Heaven...

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:38.460
<i>Heaven... I'm in Heavwen...</i>

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.100
<i>I have... 750 yen on me.</i>

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.270
<i>No... It's not like that.</i>

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:58.280
<i>It's not that I've accepted this, but I'll 
admit that I lacked awareness of it.</i>

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:01.260
<i>I'll have to look into this further later,</i>

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.990
<i>so I'm just getting it for research.</i>

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.910
<b>Endor</b>

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.910
<i>The ad on the back is pretty extreme, too...</i>

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.270
<i>There's a barcode, so I'll have 
to show it at the counter,</i>

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:12.290
<i>but it's not like the staff knows me, so...</i>

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.190
It's such a nice day today!

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.120
R-Right.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.670
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.090
Andou-san, what the hell are you doing?!

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.320
You changed jobs?

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:27.510
Or maybe he's working here and 
still delivering papers...

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.220
Thank you!

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:30.300
I don't want him to get the 
wrong idea about my interests...

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.780
I guess I don't have to buy this right now.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.890
I damaged store merchandise!

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.000
It must've been when I dove earlier...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.270
Now I <i>have</i> to buy it.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:42.940
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.110
<b>Chinese Buns</b>

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:45.110
<i>What's wrong with me buying 
something in this store?</i>

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.860
<i>What do I have to be concerned abou—</i>

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.400
<i>Of course I'm embarrassed!</i>

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:54.040
<i>You've got it all wrong! 
I'm a hardcore gamer!</i>

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.500
<i>What the hell is with this pervy ad, anyway?!</i>

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.420
But I have to buy this...

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.800
That's it! I just have to get it 
through the register, so...

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.330
Camouflage!

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.960
<i>Since time immemorial, when guy 
students would buy pervy books,</i>

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:10.720
<b>New Series</b>

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:10.720
<i>they would put a normal book on 
top to make it less conspicuous.</i>

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.270
<b>Endor</b>

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:12.780
<i>If I just put J**p on top</i>

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.760
<i>so only the barcode is showing, maybe I can...</i>

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.640
<b>Poster and color pages to 
commemorate the movie release!</b>

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.640
<b>New Series</b>

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.760
<i>All right! I'm gonna get J**p!</i>

00:06:18.760 --> 00:06:19.980
Wait, I can't!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:23.450
If I buy the BL magazine, 
I'll only have 210 yen left!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.980
That's not enough...

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.930
<i>And I finally set things 
straight with Andou-san, too...</i>

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.660
<i>Somehow, it's harder to have 
him think of me as a gamer</i>

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.290
<i>who's into this type of stuff 
than as a delinquent...</i>

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.210
I'm just going to have 
to face this head-on...

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.330
<b>Please take one</b>

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.330
<b>Let's Get Our Driver's License</b>

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.040
<b>Please take one</b>

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.470
Hey.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.460
Welcome.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.340
Did you change jobs?

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:48.550
M-Miyamo, is that you?!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.120
It's been a while!

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.980
Oh, uh, I work at the convenience 
store this day of the week.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:55.560
I-I see...

00:06:56.390 --> 00:07:00.850
<i>Okay, so far, so good. Now, as long 
as this camouflage plan works out...</i>

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:01.850
Hey!

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:03.490
This magazine...

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.650
It's free, right?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.020
It's a pamphlet for driving schools!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:08.560
Huh?

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.900
If you're getting a license at your age...

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.320
It's for a bike, right?

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:13.700
H-Huh?!

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.120
<i>He's fully exposed!</i>

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.920
U-Um...

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.620
<i>Shit!</i>

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.720
<i>I never thought he'd be so interested 
in the random magazine I picked up.</i>

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:28.360
When you let me ride with you 
on your bike the other day,

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.050
it felt really nice...

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:30.920
Huh?

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.890
<i>M-Miyamo... Wait, don't tell me...</i>

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:39.170
<i>No, as a guy, I should be the one to...</i>

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.810
Um... Could you recommend 
a driving school for me?!

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.770
S-Sure...

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>That was close...</i>

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.780
<i>Now I've blocked Andou-san's field of view.</i>

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.030
<i>But what the hell am I supposed 
to do about this pervy ad?</i>

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.540
The worst would be if someone 
tried to hit on her...

00:07:57.140 --> 00:07:59.540
<i>I know... I'll take the chocolates 
next to the register, and...</i>

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.150
<i>Draw two!</i>

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.500
I gotta find one with no idiots who think 
driving school is for picking up chicks.

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.370
<i>I'll eliminate the perviness!</i>

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:05.480
<i>Now it should be...</i>

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:10.670
<i>Huh? Did it somehow get pervier?!</i>

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.800
<i>Chocolate...</i>

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:14.070
<i>Now it looks like he's wearing 
some really erotic swimwear</i>

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:16.480
<i>that makes him stand out even more!</i>

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.010
<i>And it's 3-D, even!</i>

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.930
<b>This won't work!!</b>

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.290
<i>This won't work.</i>

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.680
<i>It's probably better without them...</i>

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.980
10 yen Chocolates

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.990
<i>No, I've got it all wrong.</i>

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.650
<i>It actually wasn't enough!</i>

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:30.150
<i>How about this?!</i>

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.910
<i>It looks like he's wearing a tank top!</i>

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.540
<i>The perviness is completely gone.</i>

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.730
<i>This is my hand!</i>

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:49.130
U-Um, it looks like this 
might take a while...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.370
So here's my email address.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.150
Let me know if you find a good place.

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:53.920
<i>Ba-dump...</i>

00:08:54.490 --> 00:08:57.470
Leave it to me.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.140
Well, I have to get to school, 
so could you ring me up?

00:09:00.730 --> 00:09:02.180
Oh, right. Sure.

00:09:06.430 --> 00:09:09.790
One magazine, and...

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.480
the sweets... um...

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:14.440
I'll add one more! That makes fifteen!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:14.990
Huh?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.740
Alcohol | Cigarettes

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.740
<b>We Will Verify
Your Age</b>

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.740
Fifteen...

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.910
And here's the money!

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:22.830
Okay, here's your change...

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.370
I don't need a bag!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.330
I-I'll just take it like this!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.500
Are you sure about that?!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.510
Huh? Wait, Miyamo!

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.420
Oh, it's fine! I'm going to 
read it on my way to school!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.050
<i>Good, good, good! That totally fooled him!</i>

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.540
<i>Mission complete! Now I just have to put 
it in my bag once I leave the store...</i>

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.140
Hold it, Miyamo!

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:43.270
Wh-What?

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:47.350
I just wanted to confirm this part 
in your address. Is it "bl" or "lol"?

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:48.650
It's "bl"!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.810
I'll be going now.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:52.270
Miyamo!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.280
The heck?!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:57.890
It's just... Are those called BL games?

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:01.660
You probably shouldn't walk around 
with that magazine out in the open.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:02.550
Huh?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:07.460
Don't get me wrong. I'm not judging 
your interests or anything.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:13.670
But... that magazine's a bit pervy, so...

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:17.470
And some people are 
prejudiced against that stuff.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:20.590
Also, it's dangerous to 
read while you're walking.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.190
I might be meddling,

00:10:24.780 --> 00:10:26.580
but I'm worried.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.270
I know... Okay.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:31.630
Just one second.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.960
We have paper bags, too.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.570
There, all set!

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.360
But to think you can't even 
wait until after school...

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.990
You must really love games, Miyamo.

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.010
Yeah...

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.130
Hey, what's with all that 
chocolate, Chio-chan?

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:52.310
Is that your lunch?

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.460
Don't judge my choices.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:56.630
What?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.140
<b>Chio's</b>

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.140
School Road

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.140
<i>Chifwo's Schfool Woad</i>!

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.810
<i>You lose.</i>

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.720
Yuzu: "You lose."

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.380
Jeez...

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:07.620
You finally contact me, and it's just to 
ask if you can borrow my gaming console?

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:09.400
I'm just doing some research.

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.600
Don't pry into it.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:13.730
Yuzu: "You belong to me now... Got it?"

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:13.730
<i>You belong to me now... Got it?</i>

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:18.520
Though, I mean... I guess this isn't the kind
of game two guys should play together, huh?

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.740
It feels kind of awkward...

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.410
A-Andou-san... I...

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:31.120
Glance... Glance...

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.530
Stare...

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:37.340
<b>Chio-chan and the Duel</b>

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.840
Hey, that girl's wearing the 
Eihei Girls' Academy uniform.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.030
That's the private school 
for super rich girls, right?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.180
It's rare to see someone 
like that around here.

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.870
Are you sure you weren't dreaming?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.440
No! They were really there!

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.160
No way!

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:47.180
No, really!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.850
But if you catch one...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.770
You two! Duel with me!

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.200
It must've been something else.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.020
No, it really was a monkey!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.350
On your roof?

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:57.860
And there were two of them!

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.190
What?

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.970
Okay, then act out what 
kind of monkeys they were.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.490
Ook! Ook, ook, ook!

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.810
They kinda looked like my dad.

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:08.010
Hurgh!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.040
Manana? Was it that funny?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.710
<b>Staaaab</b>

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:18.630
Manana?!

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:21.870
